; Test all supported combinations of lowering of vcast.to.fixed and
; vcast.from.fixed intrinsics. CodeGen isn't great as they are each
; turned into copies through the stack and the results fixed side
; gets scalarized. We expect many of these intrinsics to get paired
; up and eliminated only those that aren't paired will become stack
; copies.

